OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FTurning drier and brighter in
OL,6,Fthe south after morning rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle. Elsewhere, despite frequent
OL,8,Fblustery showers feeding into the far
OL,9,Fnorth, these heavy and wintery at
OL,10,Ftimes with coastal gales, it will
OL,11,Fremain largely dry with sunny spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTurning drier in the south,
OL,14,Fthough in the far north, frequent
OL,15,Fwintery showers persist with strong
OL,16,Fwinds. Elsewhere, despite a few light
OL,17,Fshowers, clear spells allow for
OL,18,Fwidespread frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
