OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA noticeably chillier day
OL,6,Funder northerly winds, breezier
OL,7,Ftowards coasts. Wintery showers
OL,8,Fcontinue to feed into the far north,
OL,9,Fbut elsewhere it will remain largely
OL,10,Fdry with plenty of sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
